Treadlight / 踏光：律动之旅

Derived from LIGHT//BOUND by FireEntity1:
https://github.com/FireEntity1/lightbound-demo
https://fire-entity.itch.io/lightbound

The upstream Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.
Original authorship and Git history are retained.

Treadlight adds a three-room journey, beat judgement, timed light bridges,
warning lasers, original synthesized prototype music, Chinese interface,
pause/retry flow, documentation and gameplay verification.
Modified upstream files are marked with a change notice.

The upstream music-production source directory was removed from this
derivative's current tree for Windows filename compatibility and project size.
It remains available in the upstream repository and inherited Git history.

Additional notices are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and licenses/.
